# Freminet Furina Columbina Escoffier. ~23s Rot. Phys Shatter-Freminet Double Hydro. Freminet insets an NA between skills not on CD for more Shatter damage, leading his burst to expire before the 4th Shattering pressure. Vs Freezable opponents, EM Sands Freminet is above ATK Sands with ATK% weapons.

# Team - Options ordered by DPS
freminet char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
